Module switchway "A carved way with a hidden switch" {
  Place field "a field" is wilderness.
  Place hall "the hall" is room within field at 0, 0 outdoors.
  Place gallery "the gallery" is room within field at 1, 0 outdoors.
  Passage gate "the carved way" is path between hall and gallery taking 2 minutes.
  Company party "You" of 1 at hall.
  Hazard hall_trap "the hidden switch" means "Deal (2d8) slashing damage to ally unless dexterity save against (15).".
  Discovery hall_snare_known "Among the carvings is one that is not carved but set in, a boss that would go in under a hand.".
  Thing hall_snare "the hidden switch" on gate {
    State primed dangerous "The wall here is carved all over, and the carving is thickest where the way is narrowest.".
    State sprung "The hidden switch has gone off, and is spent.".
    State made_safe "The hidden switch is made safe. Whoever goes by now goes by unharmed.".
    State drawn "The hidden switch has been set off from a pole's length away, and is spent.".
    Change spring "Push the switch in with the pole's end, standing clear" from primed to drawn needing pole after learning hall_snare_known.
    Change wedge "Wedge the switch so it cannot go in" from primed to made_safe needing trapwork after learning hall_snare_known.
    Change read "Read which of the carvings is set in, and keep your hands from it" from primed to made_safe needing lore after learning hall_snare_known.
    Change worn "Find where the carving is worn by hands that knew to miss the switch, and miss it too" from primed to made_safe needing insight after learning hall_snare_known.
    Hurts with hall_trap when primed then sprung.
  }
  Event hall_snare_goes beside gate when state(hall_snare, sprung) "A scything blade swings through the air.".
  Observe hall_snare_read beside gate of hall_snare when tried(hall_snare, looking) and state(hall_snare, primed) "Among the carvings is one that is not carved but set in." teaches hall_snare_known.
  Observe hall_scene at hall when true "A hall of carved stone.".
  Goal false.
}
